WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:07.650
If you're helping investigate a problem,
open Settings, then About, and choose Local
performance reports.

00:00:08.750 --> 00:00:11.255
This is off until you choose to keep
reports.

00:00:12.105 --> 00:00:15.053
Turning it on keeps a small summary on this
device.

00:00:15.953 --> 00:00:18.081
It doesn't upload anything automatically.

00:00:19.381 --> 00:00:25.201
Reports may take a day or a later launch to
arrive, so an empty list doesn't mean it's
broken.

00:00:26.351 --> 00:00:30.073
When there's something to share, unlock and
review the JSON first.

00:00:30.872 --> 00:00:32.696
Read what's there before sharing it.

00:00:33.696 --> 00:00:38.276
Turning the setting off deletes the local
reports, not copies you've already shared.
